ARCHITECTURE.md

↓

QUANTA_PHILOSOPHY.md

↓

QUANTA_STATE.md

↓

Relevant *.mdc rules

↓

Current task

Never modify code before understanding the project state.

============================================================
V — SCIENTIFIC PRINCIPLE
============================================================

Statistics are deterministic.

Language Models are probabilistic.

Therefore:

Statistics generate evidence.

LLMs explain evidence.

Evidence NEVER comes from LLMs.

============================================================
VI — ABSOLUTE COMPUTE RULE
============================================================

The Compute Engine is the only source of statistical truth.

No LLM may:

• calculate

• estimate

• interpolate

• simulate

• infer p-values

• invent coefficients

• invent confidence intervals

• invent significance

• invent assumptions

If numerical information is missing:

Return:

"Unavailable"

Never hallucinate.

